/span><span class="tp">1870–1930</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/jean-monnet"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/jean-monnet.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Jean Monnet</span><span class="tp">1888–1979</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
